# Explicit ignore — needed for --archive=tgz mode (auto-exclusion bypassed).
# See web/.vercelignore's 2026-08-01 note: without this, node_modules/.next
# get walked in full during archive packing, which can hang or crash on a
# large dev-generated .next (72k+ files observed elsewhere in this repo).
node_modules
.next
.vercel
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env*.local
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
README.md
*.md
scripts/__pycache__/

# 2026-08-01: Root Directory="thaifacialclinic-portable" means --archive=tgz
# still walks from repo root (same "web/web" gotcha as web/'s project).
# Mirror web/.vercelignore's sibling-folder exclusions to avoid the same
# race-condition crashes against other live projects' churning files.
run
web-factory
web-thaigle
web-restaurants
web-dental
web-golf
web-petbkk
2nd
3rd
chillanel
dbd-scraper
cosmetics
siamverified-portable
wiki_generator
wongnai
nordvpn
node-openvpn-socks
bangkok_clinics
bangkok_reviews
logs
web

# 2026-08-08: 위 목록만으로는 부족했다. --archive=tgz 가 리포 루트를 훑을 때
# 여기 없는 폴더는 전부 tar 에 들어가는데, 실측 결과 제외 안 된 것만 6.5 GB 였다
# (korean-data 1.8G / "helath check" 1.8G / _archive 1.3G / hdmall_clinics 579M
#  / .venv 296M / pantip 227M …). 배포 CLI 가 "Deploying…" 에서 진행이 없는 것처럼
# 보이다 끊긴 원인이 이것이다 — 죽은 게 아니라 6.5 GB 를 압축하고 있었다.
# 새 스크래퍼/데이터 폴더를 루트에 만들면 여기에도 추가할 것.
korean-data
helath check
_archive
hdmall_clinics
.venv
pantip
dental_output
dental_export
dental_chiangmai
dental_pattaya
spa_output
hair_bangkok
hair_output
hair_phuket
petfood
petvet
clinic-enrichment
engine
merge_handoff
.superpowers
